        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7848e419-d07d-5369-bf5a-540902a01956",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lukas Rossi, Terry Kath, Ben Moody, Miles McPherson, Josh Newell\n- Bands and Projects: Rock Star Supernova, Chicago, The Halo Method, We Are the Fallen, Evanescence, Daylight Division, In This Moment\n- Roles: rock musician, guitarist, vocalist, drummer, bassist, songwriter\n- TV and Media: CBS Television reality series \"Rock Star\"\n\nFacts:\n- Terry Alan Kath was born on January 31, 1946, and he became an American musician and songwriter.\n- Terry Alan Kath was the original guitarist, one of the lead singers, and a founding member of the rock band Chicago.\n- Lukas Rossi was born on December 21, 1976, and he is a Canadian rock musician.\n- Lukas Rossi won the CBS Television reality series \"Rock Star,\" a televised audition contest to become the lead singer of the hard rock supergroup Rock Star Supernova.\n- Terry Alan Kath died on January 23, 1978.\n- The Halo Method consisted of guitarist Ben Moody, drummer Miles McPherson, vocalist Lukas Rossi, and bassist Josh Newell.\n- Ben Moody was associated with We Are the Fallen and was formerly in Evanescence.\n- Lukas Rossi was formerly associated with Rock Star Supernova and Daylight Division.\n- Josh Newell was formerly associated with In This Moment.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a765d227-cc03-5ca4-9482-faa89194234e",
